    "lastText": "Excellent! The minisheet spreadsheet formula engine is now complete and fully functional. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Completed Implementation\n\n✅ **Core Features:**\n- Sheet class with full API (set, get, getInput)\n- Formula parser with correct operator precedence\n- Support for cell references, ranges, and function calls\n- No npm dependencies, pure Node.js implementation\n\n✅ **40+ Built-in Functions:**\n- **Math:** SUM, PRODUCT, MIN, MAX, AVERAGE, COUNT, COUNTA, COUNTBLANK, ROUND, ROUNDUP, ROUNDDOWN, INT, MOD, ABS, SQRT, POWER\n- **Logic:** IF, IFS, AND, OR, XOR, NOT, IFERROR, IFNA\n- **Text:** LEN, UPPER, LOWER, TRIM, LEFT, RIGHT, MID, CONCAT, TEXTJOIN, SUBSTITUTE, FIND, SEARCH, REPT, EXACT, VALUE\n- **Lookup:** VLOOKUP, INDEX, MATCH, CHOOSE\n- **Conditional:** SUMIF, COUNTIF, AVERAGEIF\n- **Information:** ISBLANK, ISNUMBER, ISTEXT, ISERROR, ISNA, ISLOGICAL\n\n✅ **Advanced Features:**\n- All 8 error types with proper propagation (#DIV/0!, #VALUE!, #REF!, #NAME?, #N/A, #NUM!, #CIRC!, #ERROR!)\n- Circular reference detection\n- Type coercion following spreadsheet rules\n- Case-insensitive references and functions\n- Range support with multiple aggregation functions\n\n✅ **Testing:**\n- 66 comprehensive tests, all passing\n- Tests cover basic functionality, ranges, functions, conditional aggregates, and edge cases\n- Complete documentation in README.md\n\nThe implementation is ready to use and all requirements from TASK.md have been met!",
